            <ArticleTitle>Major psychological disorders in chronic TMD patients: implications for successful management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>49-54</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors assessed psychological disorders in 50 chronic TMD patients. These disorders appear to be a major concomitant factor in chronic TMD, and may need to be treated for successful outcomes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
